<title>USA: Rockwell converts Class A common into common.</title>
<headline>Rockwell converts Class A common into common.</headline>
<dateline>SEAL BEACH, Calif. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell International Corp Monday said its Class A common stock was automatically converted, on a one-for-one basis, into shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>It is not necessary for holders of Class A common stock to exchange their certificates for common stock.</p>
</text>
